---
layout: base.njk
title: Leading
description: The bigger work Ran Craycraft has led, from launching ventures at AOL to leading thoughtbot’s Americas business and Ruby Central.
permalink: /leading/
section: leading
---
<header class="page-head">
  <h1 class="page-title serif">Leading</h1>
  <div class="grid">
    <p class="span-main lede serif">The bigger work I’ve led, told in full. What the situation was, what we did, what changed, and what I believe now because of it.</p>
  </div>
</header>

{%- set stories = collections.posts | stories %}
{#- One section per group in site.yml (leading_groups), then anything without a group #}
{%- set groups = site.leading_groups | default([]) %}
{%- set groups = (groups.concat([{ key: "", label: "More" }])) %}
{%- for g in groups %}
{%- set group = stories | ledBy(g.key) %}
{%- if group.length %}
<section class="section leading-group" aria-labelledby="led-{{ g.key or 'more' }}">
  <div class="section-head">
    <h2 id="led-{{ g.key or 'more' }}" class="eyebrow strong">{{ g.label }}</h2>
    {%- if g.note %}<p class="section-note">{{ g.note }}</p>{% endif %}
  </div>
  <div class="tiles tiles-2">
    {%- for p in group %}
    <a href="{{ p.url }}" class="card">
      <span class="media">{% set ratio = "3 / 2" %}{% include "story-cover.njk" %}</span>
      <span class="card-title card-title-lg serif">{{ p.data.title }}</span>
      <span class="card-desc">{{ p.data.description }}</span>
      {%- if p.data.case_study and p.data.case_study.organization %}<span class="card-meta">{{ p.data.case_study.organization }}</span>{% endif %}
    </a>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
{%- endif %}
{%- endfor %}
